Subject: [PATCH 3/5] crypto: sun4i-ss: queue skcipher requests through crypto_engine

Register every sun4i-ss skcipher as asynchronous and route its encrypt/decrypt
callbacks through crypto_engine. The worker invokes the algorithm's original
synchronous callback. Keep PIO and hash paths from touching the controller
while a DMA request owns it; the following patch activates that guard.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [V821 crypto_engine integration]

---
